# Input

```css
.card:not( .disabled )#id{color:red}
.card[ data-state ]#id{color:blue}
.card:not(.disabled)   #id{color:red}

```


# Formatted

```css
.card:not(.disabled)#id {
	color: red;
}
.card[data-state]#id {
	color: blue;
}
.card:not(.disabled) #id {
	color: red;
}

```
